cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Import-CaCertificates in a published report, a runbook or a thesis, cite it as below."
title: "Import-CaCertificates"
abstract: >-
  Windows PowerShell 7.4+ module and command-line wrapper that imports public Root and
  Intermediate CA certificates into Windows certificate stores only after each certificate
  matches a pinned SHA-256 fingerprint. HTTPS-only downloads, PEM and DER input,
  idempotent store handling, -WhatIf dry runs, JSON reports and documented exit codes.
type: software
authors:
